    "verdict": "REJECT",
    "reason": "The patch modifies the behavior of how Django handles `STATIC_URL` by removing the URL validation check. This could lead to unexpected behavior if `STATIC_URL` is intended to be a relative path but mistakenly contains a protocol. It also deviates from the original intent of the code, which was to prepend the script name to non-URL values."
